{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5b090020d66ce24c85c39e93cf37b6b6d7654332c082064c950d1af01fc02361",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_b:2_4_029_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce2b519c3cb62e4a5b4128f1881f2f511820da147e227240a29e8fb3ecd03dfb",
      "text": "吾主啊，你是在回应我的呼唤吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_b:2_4_029_01_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e6964f32c897323f20d3309ebedd0b973d099a45f74bbf2ba5336787d9c3ab1",
      "text": "“星空画布展”……听说唯有在被黑暗笼罩的时辰，\n其大门方会开启。当真耐人寻味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_b:2_4_029_01_09_b:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3005ac8f301140b3754383a5faa10d75cc02cbdb329ed6ee5c6829577da9e78c",
      "text": "好浪漫啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_b:2_4_029_01_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20f3ae79af62b1206847e9cb41385a4a2f7873f83f5ac66f34f792f45b057f48",
      "text": "感觉能发挥出\n阿斯兰先生的特色呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_b:2_4_029_01_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49d9321aaecaadae08e17d0a08abf041286c3285a882954a2537da223f45b3e0",
      "text": "嗯。等待着光之子民的，乃是格外的仪式！\n届时必将洋溢欢喜的呼声……哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_b:2_4_029_01_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2d46c2a279c2a7cca3f0ec06646fc132f394dd0adc444e6a51e4af19270a1e4",
      "text": "然也。等待着我的定是与之相称的仪式。那\n咏唱术的威力……呼哈哈，呼哈哈哈哈……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_b:2_4_029_01_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62645d05dc29207567a8e0825ef97c1ed1cfb340f918c57dd6f6eb78c3070a9e",
      "text": "……我要将汇聚一堂的艺术象征，再度烙印在眼底。\n如此一来，盛宴的成功便十拿九稳。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:029ass_401_2_4_029_01_09_b:2_4_029_01_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54c6f84bf2bef231b1dc7c990062fabca8ef4e3f4b29dc4e70b2ac8b2e8b4494",
      "text": "在契约之时到来之前，我便在增幅暗黑之力的\n魔之雕像室中度过吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
